Description: Core Identification Nodes Main Lobby, Deploy engine and CIN network isolation
 This architecture-independent Debian archive contains the CIN Main Lobby,
 component-aware official code deployment engine and per-application network
 access control. Install with the included user-space installer as a normal
 desktop user. Do not register this payload with apt or dpkg -i.
